    "chunk_text": "PRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA\n\nTO BE PURCHASED AT THE GOVERNMENT PUBLICATIONS BUREAU, COLOMBO 1\n\nPrice : Rs. 4.25Postage : Rs. 5.00\n\nPARLIAMENT OF THE DEMOCRATICSOCIALIST REPUBLIC OFSRI LANKA\n\nPublished as a Supplement to Part II of the Gazette of the DemocraticSocialist Republic of Sri Lanka of August 05, 2005\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\n[Certified on 02nd August, 2005]\n\nPrinted on the Order of Government\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\nPRISONS (AMENDMENT)ACT, No. 22 OF 2005\n\nPrisons (Amendment) Act, No. 22 of 20051\n\n[Certified on 02nd August, 2005]\n\nL.D.\u2014O. 46/2004.\n\nAN ACT TO AMEND THE PRISONS ORDINANCE\n\nBE it enacted by the Parliament of the Democratic SocialistRepublic of Sri Lanka as follows :\u2014\n\n1.This Act may be cited as the Prisons (Amendment)Act, No. 22 of 2005.\n\n2.Section 79 of the Prisons Ordinance (hereinafterreferred to as the \u201cprincipal enactment\u201d) is hereby amendedas follows :\u2014\n\n(i)by the repeal of paragraph (g) of that section;\n\n(ii)by the re-lettering of paragraph (h) of that section asparagraph (g).\n\n3. Section 81 of the principal enactment is herebyamended as follows :\u2014\n\n(1)in subsection (4) of that section \u2014\n\n(a)by the repeal of paragraph (d) thereof ; and\n\n(b)by the relettering of paragraph (e) thereofas paragraph (d) ;\n\n(2)by the repeal of subsection (5) and (6) of thatsection ; and\n\n(3)by the renumbering of subsections (7) and (8) assubsections (5) and (6) of that section.\n\n4. Section 86 of the principal enactment is herebyrepealed.\n\n5. In the event of any inconsistency between the Sinhalaand Tamil texts of this Act, the Sinhala text shall prevail.\n\n2\u2014P L 000333\u20145,650 (2005/06)\n\nShort title.\n\nAmendmentof section 79of theChapter 54.\n\nSinhala text toprevail in case ofinconsistency.\n\nAmendment ofsection 81 of theprincipalenactment.\n\nRepeal of section86 of the principalenactment.\n\n24Sri Lanka Transport Board Act, No. 27 of 2005"
