    "chunk_text": "4Udarata Development Authority of Sri LankaAct, No. 26 of 2005\n\n8.(1) Subject to the provisions of subsections (1) and(2) of section 7 the term of office of an appointed member ofthe Board shall be five years and such member shall beeligible for re-appointment.\n\n9.(1) The Chairman of the Authority shall, if presentpreside at every meeting of the Board. In the absence of theChairman from any such meeting, the members presentshall elect one of the members present to preside at suchmeeting.\n\n(2) The quorum for any meeting of the Board shall be fourmembers.\n\n(3) Subject to the preceding provisions of this section,the Board may regulate the procedure in regard to themeetings of the Board and the transaction of business atsuch meetings.\n\n10.The members of the Board shall be paid remunerationout of the Fund of the Authority at such rates as may bedetermined by the Minister, with the concurrence of theMinister in charge of the subject of Finance.\n\n11.No act, decision or proceeding of the Board shall bedeemed to be invalid by reason only of the existence of anyvacancy in the Board or of any defect in the appointment ofany member thereof.\n\n12.In the exercise of its powers, discharge of itsfunctions and performance of its duties, the Authority shallcomply with the general policy of the Government and withany general or special directions issued to it by the Ministerin relation to the implementation of such policy.\n\nTerm of office ofmembers.\n\nMeetings of theBoard.\n\nRemuneration ofmembers.\n\nActs notinvalidated byreason of avacancy.\n\nAuthority tocomply with thegeneral policy ofthe Government.\n\n5Udarata Development Authority of Sri LankaAct, No. 26 of 2005\n\n13.(1) The seal of the Authority shall be in the custodyof such person as the Board may from time to time decide .\n\n(2) The seal of the Authority may be altered in such manneras may be determined by the Board."
