    "chunk_text": "PARLIAMENT OF THE DEMOCRATICSOCIALIST REPUBLIC OFSRI LANKA\n\nKAPRUKA FUND ACT, No. 31 OF 2005\n\nPrinted on the Order of Government\n\n[Certified on 22nd September, 2005]\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA\n\nTO BE PURCHASED AT THE GOVERNMENT PUBLICATIONS BUREAU, COLOMBO 1\n\nPrice : Rs. 13.50Postage : Rs. 7.50\n\nPublished as a Supplement to Part II of the Gazette of the DemocraticSocialist Republic of Sri Lanka of September 23, 2005\n\n1Kapruka Fund Act, No. 31 of 2005\n\nShort title.\n\n2\u2014PL 000492\u20145,650 (07/2005)\n\n[Certified on 22nd September, 2005]\n\nL.D.\u2014O. 60/2004.\n\nAN ACT TO PROVIDE FOR THE ESTABLISHMENT OF A FUND CALLED THEKAPRUKA FUND, TO SPECIFY ITS OBJECTIVES AND POWERS ; TO PROVIDE\n\nFOR THE REGISTRATION OF KAPRUKA SOCIETIES AND TO PROVIDE FOR\n\nMATTERS CONNECTED THEREWITH OR INCIDENTAL THERETO.\n\nBE it enacted by the Parliament of the Democratic SocialistRepublic of Sri Lanka as follows :\u2014\n\n1.This Act may be cited as the Kapruka Fund Act,No. 31 of 2005.\n\nPART I\n\nESTABLISHMENT OF THE KAPRUKA FUND\n\n2.(1) There shall be established a Fund which shall becalled the Kapruka Fund (hereinafter referred to as \u201ctheFund\u201d)\n\n(2) The Fund shall, by the name assigned to it bysubsection (1) of this section, be a body corporate and shallhave perpetual succession and a common seal and may sueand be sued in such name.\n\n3.(1) The administration, management and control ofthe Fund shall be vested in a Board of Managementconstituted as hereinafter provided.\n\n(2) The Board of Management of the Fund (hereinafterreferred to as \u201cthe Board\u201d) shall consist of the followingmembers :\u2014\n\n(a)the Chairman of the Coconut Cultivation Board ;\n\n(b)the Chairman of the Coconut DevelopmentAuthority ;\n\n(c)the Chairman of the Coconut Research Board ;\n\nEstablishment ofthe KaprukaFund.\n\nConstitution ofthe Board ofManagement ofthe Fund.\n\n2Kapruka Fund Act, No. 31 of 2005"
  },
