    "chunk_text": "PRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA\n\nTO BE PURCHASED AT THE GOVERNMENT PUBLICATIONS BUREAU, COLOMBO 1\n\nPrice : Rs. 4.25 Postage : Rs. 5.00\n\nPARLIAMENT OF THE DEMOCRATICSOCIALIST REPUBLIC OFSRI LANKA\n\nPublished as a Supplement to Part II of the Gazette of the DemocraticSocialist Republic of Sri Lanka of August 25, 2006\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\n[Certified on 21st August, 2006]\n\nPrinted on the Order of Government\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\nSRI LANKA INSTITUTE OF ADVANCEDTECHNICAL EDUCATION (AMENDMENT)ACT, No. 25 OF 2006\n\n1Sri Lanka Institute of Advanced TechnicalEducation (Amendment) Act, No. 25 of 2006\n\n[Certified on 21st August, 2006]\n\nL.D.\u2014O. 5/2005.\n\nAN ACT TO AMEND THE SRI LANKA INSTITUTE OF ADVANCEDTECHNICAL EDUCATION ACT, NO. 29 OF 1995\n\nBE it enacted by the Parliament of the Democratic SocialistRepublic of Sri Lanka as follows :-\n\n1.This Act may be cited as the Sri Lanka Institute ofAdvanced Technical Education (Amendment) Act, No. 25of 2006.\n\n2.The Long Title to the Sri Lanka Institute of AdvancedTechnical Education Act, No. 29 of 1995 (hereinafter referredto as the \u201cprincipal enactment\u201d) is hereby amended, by thesubstitution for the words \u201cAN ACT TO PROVIDE FOR THEESTABLISHMENT OF THE SRI LANKA INSTITUTE OFADVANCED TECHNICAL EDUCATION;\u201d of the words\u201cAN ACT TO PROVIDE FOR THE, ESTABLISHMENTOF THE SRI LANKA INSTITUTE OF ADVANCEDTECHNOLOGICAL EDUCATION;\u201d.\n\n3.(1) In the principal enactment and in any other writtenlaw, there shall be substituted\u2014\n\n(a)for the words \u201cSri Lanka Institute of AdvancedTechnical Education\u201d of the words \u201cSri LankaInstitute of Advanced Technological Education\u201d;\n\n(b)for the words \u201cAdvanced Technical Institute\u201d or\u201cAdvanced Technical Institutes\u201d of the words\u201cAdvanced Technological Institute\u201d or \u201cAdvancedTechnological Institutes\u201d as the case may be."
